@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 启动充电时序图 (含 Mock 充电机客户端)

' 所有 SQL 操作使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定，禁止字符串拼接
actor 用户 as U
participant "Mock充电机\n(Swing 客户端)" as MC
participant "Flutter 客户端" as FE
participant "充电控制器" as Ctrl
participant "安全过滤器链" as Security
participant "充电服务" as Service
participant "用户服务" as US
participant "充电桩服务" as CS
database 数据库 as DB

U -> FE: 选择充电桩，点击"启动充电"
FE -> MC: API 调用: 通知充电机就绪\n{chargerId, stationId}

group Mock充电机交互 [Swing UI]
  MC -> MC: 显示插枪提示界面\n等待用户模拟插枪操作
  note right MC : ChargerUIPanel 显示\n"请插入充电枪"对话框

  U -> MC: 点击"模拟插枪"按钮
  MC -> MC: 更新 ChargerUIPanel 状态\n显示"已插枪，请刷卡启动"

  MC -> MC: 模拟刷卡认证\n获取模拟 JWT Token (mock_charger_only 作用域)
  note right MC : Mock 模式下使用专用测试账号\nToken scope = mock_charger_only\n仅允许访问 /api/v1/charges/* 端点\n使用隔离测试用户数据，不影响真实用户\n不绕过余额校验
end

MC -> Ctrl: HTTP POST /api/v1/charges/start\n{chargerId}
note right MC : MockChargerClient.callStartApi()\n模拟用户 JWT Token\nJSON 请求体

group 授权检查 [Spring Security Filter Chain]
  Ctrl -> Security: JwtAuthenticationFilter 解析 Token\n提取 principal (userId, role, scope)

  alt Token scope = mock_charger_only && request path NOT in /api/v1/charges/*
    Security --> Ctrl: HTTP 403 Forbidden {error: "Mock 客户端作用域不足"}
    note right Security : Mock scope 仅允许访问充电端点\n其他路径被拒绝
  else 有效 Token
    Security -> Security: @PreAuthorize("isAuthenticated()")
    note right Security : 验证请求携带有效 JWT Token\n不通过则返回 401 Unauthorized
  end
end

Ctrl -> Service: 启动充电请求

Service -> US: 查询用户信息
US -> DB: SELECT id, name, balance FROM users WHERE id = ? -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定
DB --> US: 用户信息
US --> Service: 用户存在，余额 >= 10元

Service -> US: 检查账户冻结状态
US -> DB: SELECT frozen_until FROM users WHERE id = ? -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定
DB --> US: frozen_until IS NULL 或已过期
US --> Service: 账户未冻结

Service -> CS: 查询充电桩状态
CS -> DB: SELECT id, status FROM chargers WHERE id = ? -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定
DB --> CS: status = idle
CS --> Service: 桩空闲

Service -> CS: 锁定充电桩
CS -> DB: UPDATE chargers SET status = 'charging' WHERE id = ? AND status = 'idle' -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定，乐观写
DB --> CS: 更新成功 (affected_rows = 1)

Service -> DB: INSERT INTO charge_records (id, user_id, charger_id, start_time, status) -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定
note right DB : status = 'processing'\ndeduction_status = 'pending'
DB --> Service: 创建成功

Service -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (actor_id, actor_type, action, resource, resource_id) VALUES (?, 'user', 'start_charge', 'charger', ?) -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定
DB --> Service: 审计日志记录成功

Service --> Ctrl: 启动成功 {recordId, startTime}
Ctrl --> MC: HTTP 200 JSON {recordId, startTime, status: 'processing'}

group Mock充电机充电中显示 [Swing UI]
  MC -> MC: 更新 ChargerUIPanel 状态\n显示"充电中"图标
  MC -> MC: ChargeSimulator 启动模拟\n每 tick 增加 0.1kWh
  note right MC : 模拟电量增长\n进度条实时更新\n显示当前电量/费用/时长
end

MC --> FE: 充电状态推送 {status: 'processing'}
FE --> U: 显示"充电中"状态
@enduml